    { "type": "text",
      "body": "Vision House is a creative agency and production house working across advertising, brand communication, and film production.\n\nThe identity was developed to bring these disciplines together under one distinctive visual presence — balancing the strategic confidence of a creative agency with the visual character of a production company.\n\nThe result is a flexible identity system designed to communicate consistently across presentations, digital platforms, branded materials, and production-related applications." },

